## Surviving obstructions

- The registry proves substitution only for one canonical JSON echo operation and two deterministic fixture-backed profiles.
- The Codex profile is canned fixture replay; no live Codex, Claude, Gemini, compiler, Lean, or human gauge is activated or shown equivalent.
- Declared license identifiers are contract data, not grants. GTOC-3 license completeness remains S02-002 work.
- No independent process or binary separation is claimed; evaluator logic and identity are distinct within one bounded crate.
- No runtime conductor host consumes these receipts yet.
- No human authority promotion, protected enforcement, gate activation, or autonomous successor creation occurred.

## Nonclaims

This sprint does not claim provider parity, authorize model access, prove general operator interchangeability, establish GTOC-3, derive QM, certify every carrier, mint authority, activate gates, or make Omega Engine self-authorizing.
